Z||000002||william_thorniii||12-18-2000||12:02 PM||||Scott,<P>Why would you have them painted?  They should be powder coated.  Most wheel vendors offer this service for a small charge.  The powder will not chip/scratch as easily.  I definitely would NOT recomend painting for this reason.  By the time you get around to purchasing your Mille Miglia's I will definitely have an oven large enough for 16"s... I hope.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||3
